### 1) BAŞARILI: Ayşe, oda 101, 3 gece → 201 Created, toplam 9000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2026-12-20",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-12-23",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 2) ÇAKIŞMA: oda 201 zaten dolu → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 4,
  "checkInDate": "2026-12-22",
  "checkOutDate": "2026-12-26",
  "guestCount": 2
}

### 3) KAPASİTE: oda 101 en fazla 2 kişi → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12",
  "guestCount": 3
}

### 4) EKSİK ALAN: oda ve kişi sayısı yok → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12"
}

### 5) OLMAYAN ODA → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 999,
  "checkInDate": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOutDate": "2027-01-12",
  "guestCount": 1
}

### 6) Tüm rezervasyonları listele
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations